04/18", weight="68", tooltip="NEIRA Boys Fours, Pomfret v. Belmont Hill, Hopkins, Northfield Mt. Hermon, St. Mary's (Lynn)			
Distance: 1500M Conditions: Light crossing headwind 8mph (with infrequent gusts of up to 15 mph). Wind decreased in the last 400 meters. Insignificant chop. Comments: Note: Pomfret boys both raced down (this race should not count for Pomfret boys NEIRA seeding). 
Good conditions, improved slightly over the course of race. Alternated races with girls. Boys order of racing was: B4, B3, B2, B1, B5.
Thanks to our guests for being great competitors and exhibiting great sportsmanship.
